{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-split-panel",
  "category": "layout",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-split-panel&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Documentación y demos del componente iswc-split-panel de InSoft.",
  "styles": [
    ".panel-demo {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      place-items: center;",
    "      height: 100%;",
    "      padding: 1em;",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg-soft);",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text);",
    "      font: 0.95rem var(--iswc-sans);",
    "      border-radius: 6px;",
    "      overflow: hidden;",
    "    }",
    "    .panel-demo--alt { background: var(--iswc-bg-elev); }",
    "    .panel-demo h4 {",
    "      margin: 0 0 0.5em;",
    "      font-size: 0.95rem;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "    }",
    "    .split-stage {",
    "      height: 220px;",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius);",
    "      overflow: hidden;",
    "      margin: 12px 0 24px;",
    "      box-shadow: var(--iswc-shadow);",
    "    }",
    "    .split-stage--tall { height: 360px; }",
    "    .split-stage--square { height: 320px; }",
    "    .reposition-log {",
    "      font-family: var(--iswc-mono);",
    "      font-size: 0.78rem;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "      margin: 6px 0 18px;",
    "    }"
  ],
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-split-panel",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "Dos paneles adyacentes separados por un divisor arrastrable.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "html": [
            "<strong>Persistencia:</strong> con <code class=\"code\">storage-key=\"mi-panel\"</code> el tamaño se guarda en",
            "          <code class=\"code\">localStorage['is-webcomponents']</code> como JSON compartido por todos los WC:",
            "          <code class=\"code\">{ \"iswc-split-panel\": { \"mi-panel\": { \"positionInPixels\": 240 } } }</code>.",
            "          Sin <code class=\"code\">storage-key</code> no escribe nada."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"split-stage\">",
            "          <iswc-split-panel id=\"introSplit\" storage-key=\"demo-intro\" style=\"height: 100%;\">",
            "            <div slot=\"start\" class=\"panel-demo\">",
            "              <h4>Start</h4>",
            "              <p>Arrastra el divisor →</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div slot=\"end\" class=\"panel-demo panel-demo--alt\">",
            "              <h4>End</h4>",
            "              <p>← Arrastra el divisor</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </iswc-split-panel>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": [
            "<iswc-split-panel>",
            "  <div slot=\"start\">Start</div>",
            "  <div slot=\"end\">End</div>",
            "</iswc-split-panel>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "horizontal",
      "title": "Horizontal",
      "lede": "Por defecto <code class=\"code\">orientation=\"horizontal\"</code>: el divisor se mueve en X.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"split-stage\">",
            "          <iswc-split-panel style=\"height: 100%;\">",
            "            <div slot=\"start\" class=\"panel-demo\">",
            "              <h4>Panel A</h4>",
            "              <p>50% al cargar</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div slot=\"end\" class=\"panel-demo panel-demo--alt\">",
            "              <h4>Panel B</h4>",
            "              <p>50% al cargar</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </iswc-split-panel>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": [
            "<iswc-split-panel orientation=\"horizontal\">",
            "  ...",
            "</iswc-split-panel>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vertical",
      "title": "Vertical",
      "lede": [
        "Con <code class=\"code\">orientation=\"vertical\"</code> el divisor se mueve en Y.",
        "          Ideal para listas en la parte superior y detalles abajo."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"split-stage split-stage--square\">",
            "          <iswc-split-panel orientation=\"vertical\" style=\"height: 100%;\">",
            "            <div slot=\"start\" class=\"panel-demo\">",
            "              <h4>Top</h4>",
            "              <p>Lista</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div slot=\"end\" class=\"panel-demo panel-demo--alt\">",
            "              <h4>Bottom</h4>",
            "              <p>Detalle</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </iswc-split-panel>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": [
            "<iswc-split-panel orientation=\"vertical\">",
            "  <div slot=\"start\">Top</div>",
            "  <div slot=\"end\">Bottom</div>",
            "</iswc-split-panel>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "primary-end",
      "title": "Primary end",
      "lede": [
        "Con <code class=\"code\">primary=\"end\"</code> el panel final mantiene su tamaño cuando el host cambia de dimensión;",
        "          el inicial crece/se encoge. Por defecto (<code class=\"code\">primary=\"start\"</code>) es al revés."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"split-stage\">",
            "          <iswc-split-panel primary=\"end\" style=\"height: 100%;\">",
            "            <div slot=\"start\" class=\"panel-demo\">",
            "              <h4>Crece/se encoge</h4>",
            "              <p>Resize the window</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div slot=\"end\" class=\"panel-demo panel-demo--alt\">",
            "              <h4>Mantiene tamaño</h4>",
            "              <p>200px aprox</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </iswc-split-panel>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": [
            "<iswc-split-panel primary=\"end\" position-in-pixels=\"240\">",
            "  ...",
            "</iswc-split-panel>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "snap",
      "title": "Snap",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">snap</code> define puntos de anclaje. Acepta px y %. El <code class=\"code\">snap-threshold</code> (default 12px) es la ventana de tolerancia.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"split-stage\">",
            "          <iswc-split-panel snap=\"25% 50% 75%\" style=\"height: 100%;\">",
            "            <div slot=\"start\" class=\"panel-demo\">",
            "              <h4>Snap 25 / 50 / 75</h4>",
            "              <p>Intenta posicionarte cerca</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div slot=\"end\" class=\"panel-demo panel-demo--alt\">",
            "              <h4>End</h4>",
            "              <p>El divisor \"salta\"</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </iswc-split-panel>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": [
            "<iswc-split-panel",
            "  snap=\"25% 50% 75%\"",
            "  snap-threshold=\"12\">",
            "  ...",
            "</iswc-split-panel>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "disabled",
      "title": "Disabled",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">disabled</code> bloquea drag y teclado. El divisor deja de ser focoable.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"split-stage\">",
            "          <iswc-split-panel disabled style=\"height: 100%;\">",
            "            <div slot=\"start\" class=\"panel-demo\">",
            "              <h4>Bloqueado</h4>",
            "              <p>Drag deshabilitado</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div slot=\"end\" class=\"panel-demo panel-demo--alt\">",
            "              <h4>Bloqueado</h4>",
            "              <p>Drag deshabilitado</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </iswc-split-panel>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": [
            "<iswc-split-panel disabled>",
            "  ...",
            "</iswc-split-panel>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "keyboard",
      "title": "Teclado",
      "lede": [
        "Foco en el divisor (Tab) y luego:",
        "          <code class=\"code\">←/→</code> mueve 1%, <code class=\"code\">Shift</code> ×10.",
        "          <code class=\"code\">Home</code>/<code class=\"code\">End</code> salta a los extremos.",
        "          <code class=\"code\">Enter</code> colapsa y restaura el panel primario."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"split-stage\">",
            "          <iswc-split-panel id=\"kbdSplit\" style=\"height: 100%;\">",
            "            <div slot=\"start\" class=\"panel-demo\">",
            "              <h4>Foco aquí y prueba:</h4>",
            "              <p>← → Home End Enter</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div slot=\"end\" class=\"panel-demo panel-demo--alt\">",
            "              <h4>End</h4>",
            "              <p>id=\"kbdSplit\"</p>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </iswc-split-panel>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "methods",
      "title": "API JavaScript",
      "lede": "Como cualquier custom element, accedes con <code class=\"code\">document.querySelector('iswc-split-panel')</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Propiedad",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>position</code>",
              "Posición del divisor en % (atributo reflected)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>positionInPixels</code>",
              "Posición en píxeles. Útil para persistencia."
            ],
            [
              "<code>orientation</code>",
              "Eje del divisor."
            ],
            [
              "<code>primary</code>",
              "Panel que mantiene tamaño al resize."
            ],
            [
              "<code>disabled</code>",
              "Bloquea drag + teclado."
            ],
            [
              "<code>snap</code>",
              "\"100px 50%\" — anclajes separados por espacio."
            ],
            [
              "<code>snapThreshold</code>",
              "Px de tolerancia para snap. Default 12."
            ],
            [
              "<code>storageKey</code>",
              "Id único; persiste tamaño en <code>localStorage['is-webcomponents']</code>."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h4>Demo en vivo</h4>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"split-stage\" style=\"height: 180px;\">",
            "            <iswc-split-panel id=\"apiSplit\" style=\"height: 100%;\">",
            "              <div slot=\"start\" class=\"panel-demo\"><h4>Start</h4><p>Pos: <span id=\"apiPos\">50</span>%</p></div>",
            "              <div slot=\"end\" class=\"panel-demo panel-demo--alt\"><h4>End</h4></div>",
            "            </iswc-split-panel>",
            "          </div>",
            "",
            "          <div class=\"demo-row\" style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"apiPosBtn\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">position += 10</iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"apiEnd\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">primary=end</iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"apiStart\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">primary=start</iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"apiVertical\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">toggle orientation</iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"apiDisabled\" color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">toggle disabled</iswc-button>",
            "          </div>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:storage-key",
              "label": "storage-key"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:orientation",
              "label": "orientation"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:primary",
              "label": "primary"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:snap",
              "label": "snap"
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:disabled",
              "label": "disabled"
            }
          ],
          "equivNote": "orientation + primary definen qué panel absorbe el resize.",
          "equivHtml": "<!-- ver diagrama de ramas -->",
          "equivFlow": [
            "<iswc-flowchart open-on-click animation=\"flow\">",
            "  <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "  {",
            "    \"flowchart\": {",
            "      \"title\": \"iswc-split-panel: primary\",",
            "      \"direction\": \"TB\",",
            "      \"nodes\": [",
            "        {",
            "          \"id\": \"q\",",
            "          \"label\": \"orientation=?\",",
            "          \"shape\": \"diamond\"",
            "        },",
            "        {",
            "          \"id\": \"a\",",
